<title>USA: Japan, U.S. to aim for Dec 15 insurance deal -- Kubo.</title>
<headline>Japan, U.S. to aim for Dec 15 insurance deal -- Kubo.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japanese Finance Minister Wataru Kubo said on Tuesday that Japan and the United States will aim to reach an agreement on their bilateral insurance issue by December 15.</p>
<p>&quot;Ms (U.S. Trade Representative Charlene) Barshefsky and I held negotiations on September 29 and 30. We have agreed to commit to continue talks for a final agreement by December 15, 1996,&quot; Kubo told reporters in Washington.</p>
</text>
